        "original_id": "e01a8292-7ae5-5636-8599-72ed167462cd",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Hinterland, Hinterland: Orc Lords\n- Companies: Tilted Mill Entertainment\n- Concepts: Orcs, fantasy role-playing video games, city-building elements\n- People: Schenkhuizen, Grubby\n\nFacts:\n- Hinterland is a high fantasy role-playing video game with city-building elements by Tilted Mill Entertainment.\n- In March 2009, Hinterland: Orc Lords was released to digital distribution and retail as a cumulative expansion for Hinterland.\n- Hinterland: Orc Lords added the ability to play as Orc characters.\n- An orc, also spelled ork, is a fictional humanoid creature in a fantasy race akin to goblins.\n- As an Orc player, Schenkhuizen, known as Grubby, has won more than 38 LAN tournaments, including six World Championships.",
